      "text": "```yaml\n- id: DR-01\n  requirement: >\n    The service must allow users to add new drones to the fleet.\n- id: DR-02\n  requirement: >\n    The service must allow users to retire drones from the fleet.\n- id: DR-03\n  requirement: >\n    The service must allow users to record and set up charging pads at sites.\n- id: DR-04\n  requirement: >\n    The service must allow users to send drones to charge.\n- id: DR-05\n  requirement: >\n    The service must allow users to take drones out of service for repairs.\n- id: DR-06\n  requirement: >\n    The service must allow users to return drones to active service once they are fixed.\n- id: DR-07\n  requirement: >\n    The service must support planning and dispatching delivery flights that carry a load from one site to another.\n- id: DR-08\n  requirement: >\n    The service must support planning and dispatching inspection flights that navigate a drone with designated sensors through an ordered list of points and return to the starting location.\n- id: DR-09\n  requirement: >\n    The service must allow dispatchers to select the drone and the flight corridor or way it flies, and sign off on the flight prior to operation.\n- id: DR-10\n  requirement: >\n    The service must not automatically select a drone or a flight path for any flight.\n- id: DR-11\n  requirement: >\n    The service must identify and display which drones are able to reach the starting location of a job.\n- id: DR-12\n  requirement: >\n    The service must not restart or apply system updates during working hours while drones are actively flying.\n- id: DR-13\n  requirement: >\n    The service must maintain a shared representation of the airspace, including the network of flight corridors between sites.\n- id: DR-14\n  requirement: >\n    The service must allow flight corridors to be grouped into zones.\n- id: DR-15\n  requirement: >\n    The service must allow users to enter airspace closures announced by authorities.\n- id: DR-16\n  requirement: >\n    The service must report the extent of disruption caused across customers when an airspace closure is entered.\n```",
